{
  "movie_id": 510200601,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 3.2,
      "end_time": 5.5,
      "text": "Well, it's a hassle but I guess I have to do\nit."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 6.2,
      "end_time": 7.5,
      "text": "Please strengthen us."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 7.7,
      "end_time": 8.4,
      "text": "Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 8.8,
      "end_time": 10.0,
      "text": "Ha!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 11.2,
      "end_time": 12.7,
      "text": "Well then, shall we go?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 13.5,
      "end_time": 15.2,
      "text": "If you liked games, then"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 16.3,
      "end_time": 17.5,
      "text": "Even if you win with cheats,"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 17.7,
      "end_time": 20.0,
      "text": "I'm sure you know that I'm not happy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 21.2,
      "end_time": 23.0,
      "text": "What's wrong with that!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 25.2,
      "end_time": 28.3,
      "text": "I cast aside such a meaningless emotion as\n\"love\""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 28.7,
      "end_time": 32.3,
      "text": "I have become loved by the people of\nLandosol!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 33.2,
      "end_time": 35.7,
      "text": "Games, manga, cosplay, and sword dancing"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 36.2,
      "end_time": 40.0,
      "text": "This isn't just for the sake of gaining\nviews!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 40.4,
      "end_time": 41.4,
      "text": "No way!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 41.6,
      "end_time": 44.7,
      "text": "Every content is a tool to increase the\nnumbers!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 45.2,
      "end_time": 47.2,
      "text": "Wow~!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 47.8,
      "end_time": 48.5,
      "text": "Sweet!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 51.6,
      "end_time": 54.4,
      "text": "You said that the feeling of 'liking' is\nprecious."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 55.2,
      "end_time": 57.7,
      "text": "But there's no need for such emotions!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 58.6,
      "end_time": 59.2,
      "text": "No!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 60.5,
      "end_time": 63.3,
      "text": "The feeling of 'liking' is something\nimportant!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 64.2,
      "end_time": 65.1,
      "text": "In my heart..."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 65.5,
      "end_time": 67.3,
      "text": "It is truly my pillar of support!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 67.5,
      "end_time": 69.5,
      "text": "Woah!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 75.1,
      "end_time": 76.1,
      "text": "When I've been lost..."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 76.3,
      "end_time": 77.8,
      "text": "When I hit a wall..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 78.1,
      "end_time": 82.6,
      "text": "Magical girls have always been by my side, no\nmatter what."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 83.3,
      "end_time": 87.2,
      "text": "You've also had the experience of being saved\nby something you love..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 87.5,
      "end_time": 89.3,
      "text": "I'm pretty sure you said that!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 90.1,
      "end_time": 91.5,
      "text": "That's..."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 92.7,
      "end_time": 95.5,
      "text": "(Once, the things I loved were the support of\nmy heart)"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 98.4,
      "end_time": 104.4,
      "text": "(Well, what supports me now, after I've\nabandoned the feeling of love...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 105.1,
      "end_time": 106.3,
      "text": "Haaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 112.6,
      "end_time": 113.6,
      "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 114.2,
      "end_time": 115.0,
      "text": "(Why...!?)"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 115.2,
      "end_time": 117.1,
      "text": "(Why do I feel dazzled by this child...!?)"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 117.2,
      "end_time": 118.4,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 118.6,
      "end_time": 120.5,
      "text": "I will endure my \"love\"!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 122.2,
      "end_time": 126.2,
      "text": "(I should have had the same feelings as this\nchild once...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 127.6,
      "end_time": 129.5,
      "text": "Haaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 132.1,
      "end_time": 136.0,
      "text": "(Why did I forget something so important...)"
    }
  ],
